---
import GameLayout from "../../../layouts/GameLayout.astro";
---

<GameLayout title="OverTheWire: Blacksun Level 2" gameName="blacksun" level={2}>
    <p class="leading-[24px] mb-4">
        Level2 is a test application from a <a
            href="http://brouits.free.fr/libspopc/"
            class="text-[#999] hover:text-[#CCC] no-underline">pop3 library</a
        > that's pretty buggy. The idea is to write a pop3 server to trigger a vulnerability
        (pick any you like :p) in the code and get a shell.
    </p>

    <p class="leading-[24px] mb-4 font-bold">Notes</p>

    <ul class="list-disc list-inside pl-4 leading-[24px] mb-4">
        <li>
            -fpic -fPIC was added to the compile options to remote DT_TEXTREL's
            :p
        </li>
        <li>
            If you're feeling generous, perhaps drop the author a note about any
            bugs you find so that future versions of the library can be fixed.
        </li>
        <li>ASLR remote fun!</li>
    </ul>

    <h3 class="text-[18pt] font-normal text-[#999] mt-6 mb-2">
        Binary information
    </h3>

    <div class="p-4 mb-4 bg-[#F7F7F9] border border-[#E1E1E8] rounded">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-[1fr_2fr] gap-2">
            <div class="font-bold text-right">
                Stack smashing protection (SSP):
            </div>
            <div>Disabled</div>

            <div class="font-bold text-right">
                Postition Independent Executable (PIE):
            </div>
            <div>Disabled</div>

            <div class="font-bold text-right">
                Address space layout randomisation (ASLR):
            </div>
            <div>Enabled</div>

            <div class="font-bold text-right">Non-executable pages:</div>
            <div>None / disabled</div>

            <div class="col-span-2 border-t border-[#CCC] my-2"></div>

            <div class="font-bold text-right">Code Location:</div>
            <div>
                /levels/2/libspopc-0.7, using poptest1.c, and associated library
                code
            </div>

            <div class="font-bold text-right">Location:</div>
            <div>/levels/level2</div>
        </div>
    </div>
</GameLayout>
